    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Tabletop Tavern: Command, Conquer, Repeat</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/extras/bae1274bd9edcf4ef4bdd887a56e3329.poster.avif?t=1748272750\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/extras/bae1274bd9edcf4ef4bdd887a56e3329.webm?t=1748272750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/extras/bae1274bd9edcf4ef4bdd887a56e3329.mp4?t=1748272750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Tabletop Tavern, a real-time strategy roguelike where every battle is a roll of the dice\u2014and every victory is earned. Command your mercenaries on a chaotic tabletop battlefield, recruit a wild roster of warriors, and forge your legacy against relentless goblin hordes. With infinite builds, brutal choices, and endless replayability, this is RTS chaos for roguelike fanatics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/extras/05a4b7d86e0d8e9a8947da0ee6ab12d6.poster.avif?t=1748272750\" width=616 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/extras/05a4b7d86e0d8e9a8947da0ee6ab12d6.webm?t=1748272750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/extras/05a4b7d86e0d8e9a8947da0ee6ab12d6.mp4?t=1748272750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Tactics:</strong> Lead your troops in dynamic, tabletop battles where every move counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit Your Army</strong>: Assemble a diverse band of mercenaries\u2014each with unique skills, quirks, and backstories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Mastery</strong>: No two runs are the same. Discover powerful gear, craft game-changing builds, and adapt to survive an ever-shifting gauntlet of challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the Horde</strong>: Outsmart and outfight ferocious goblin armies hellbent on your demise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tough Choices, Epic Rewards</strong>: Sacrifice, strategize, and seize glory in a world that punishes the timid.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/extras/2a9f484f1fef2f1de077c55e1845d34b.poster.avif?t=1748272750\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/extras/2a9f484f1fef2f1de077c55e1845d34b.webm?t=1748272750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/extras/2a9f484f1fef2f1de077c55e1845d34b.mp4?t=1748272750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rise as a legendary commander\u2014or crumble under the weight of the tabletop? Gather your troops and find out.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Tabletop Tavern: Command, Conquer, Repeat</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/extras/bae1274bd9edcf4ef4bdd887a56e3329.poster.avif?t=1748272750\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/extras/bae1274bd9edcf4ef4bdd887a56e3329.webm?t=1748272750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/extras/bae1274bd9edcf4ef4bdd887a56e3329.mp4?t=1748272750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Tabletop Tavern, a real-time strategy roguelike where every battle is a roll of the dice\u2014and every victory is earned. Command your mercenaries on a chaotic tabletop battlefield, recruit a wild roster of warriors, and forge your legacy against relentless goblin hordes. With infinite builds, brutal choices, and endless replayability, this is RTS chaos for roguelike fanatics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/extras/05a4b7d86e0d8e9a8947da0ee6ab12d6.poster.avif?t=1748272750\" width=616 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/extras/05a4b7d86e0d8e9a8947da0ee6ab12d6.webm?t=1748272750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/extras/05a4b7d86e0d8e9a8947da0ee6ab12d6.mp4?t=1748272750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Tactics:</strong> Lead your troops in dynamic, tabletop battles where every move counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit Your Army</strong>: Assemble a diverse band of mercenaries\u2014each with unique skills, quirks, and backstories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Mastery</strong>: No two runs are the same. Discover powerful gear, craft game-changing builds, and adapt to survive an ever-shifting gauntlet of challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the Horde</strong>: Outsmart and outfight ferocious goblin armies hellbent on your demise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tough Choices, Epic Rewards</strong>: Sacrifice, strategize, and seize glory in a world that punishes the timid.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/extras/2a9f484f1fef2f1de077c55e1845d34b.poster.avif?t=1748272750\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/extras/2a9f484f1fef2f1de077c55e1845d34b.webm?t=1748272750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337380/extras/2a9f484f1fef2f1de077c55e1845d34b.mp4?t=1748272750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rise as a legendary commander\u2014or crumble under the weight of the tabletop? Gather your troops and find out.</p>",
